                "description": "The Sandcast Bronze Montrose Lever with Round Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 3 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. The square twist lever design adds a uniqueness that makes it a great choice for traditional homes. The Montrose Sandcast Bronze Leverset with #2 Round Rose is easy to install and is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes.",
